1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:02,470
You can’t collect what you can’t see.

2
00:00:05,617 --> 00:00:08,573
Every denial, with the reason the payer gave.

3
00:00:08,573 --> 00:00:14,686
Category, amount, priority, and the date the appeal window shuts.

4
00:00:14,686 --> 00:00:28,383
A new one gets recorded against the claim it belongs to.

5
00:00:28,383 --> 00:00:35,941
The reason code is the whole story — it decides whether this is worth appealing.

6
00:00:35,941 --> 00:00:42,972
On the queue, with its deadline. Not in somebody’s inbox.

7
00:00:42,972 --> 00:00:48,885
And the receivable stays visible until the money actually arrives.

8
00:00:48,885 --> 00:00:53,954
Open, partial, paid, written off — the difference between hoping and knowing.

9
00:00:54,002 --> 00:01:00,042
Visible beats optimistic. — Every denial with its reason, every receivable with its status.
